sequenceDiagram
        autonumber
        actor User
        participant Page as Web Page (Content Script)
        participant SW as Background Service Worker
        participant Offscreen as Offscreen Document (AI Worker)
        participant DB as Shared IndexedDB (articles / contents / chunks)
        participant SidePanel as Side Panel UI (React)

        User->>Page: Clicks "Remember" (or presses Alt+S)
        Page->>Page: Clone DOM, run Readability + Turndown (Markdown) & split into ~160-word chunks
        Page->>SW: chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: "INDEX_PAGE_DATA", payload })
        SW->>SW: Check current IndexedDB usage against user's maxStorageBytes cap (default 50 MB)
        alt Quota Exceeded (or >= 85% Warning)
            SW->>SidePanel: Emit { type: "STORAGE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED", suggestedNewCapBytes: 250MB }
            SidePanel->>User: Prompt: "Allocate disk space (default 250 MB) or Clean up existing articles"
        else Within Quota
            SW->>DB: Save ArticleRecord (status: "indexing") & ArticleContentRecord (Markdown/Text)
            SW->>SW: Ensure Offscreen Document exists
            SW->>Offscreen: chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: "GENERATE_EMBEDDINGS_JOB", articleId, textChunks })
            Offscreen->>Offscreen: Run @huggingface/transformers (all-MiniLM-L6-v2) via WebGPU/WASM
            Offscreen->>DB: Direct atomic write: Save Float32Array(384) chunks & update status="indexed"
            Offscreen->>SW: Notify { type: "ARTICLE_INDEXED", articleId }
            SW->>SidePanel: Update toolbar badge (✓) & refresh Side Panel contextual banner
        end

        Note over User,SidePanel: User searches & jumps to highlighted passage
        User->>SidePanel: Types query: "prevent Go race condition"
        SidePanel->>Offscreen: Search request ({ type: "SEARCH_QUERY", query })
        Offscreen->>Offscreen: Embed query into Float32Array(384)
        Offscreen->>DB: Scan chunks & compute Hybrid Score (Cosine Similarity + Lexical Match)
        Offscreen-->>SidePanel: Ranked matching articles & best snippets
        User->>SidePanel: Clicks matching snippet card
        SidePanel->>Page: Focus tab & send { type: "SCROLL_AND_HIGHLIGHT", snippet }
        Page->>Page: Scroll smoothly & highlight passage via CSS Custom Highlight API